:: Xavier Hang Out Park Shirt Fly Up [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You are walking around the park with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>, trying to think of what to do, when you spot the small merry-go-round in the playground. It looks fun, spinning around at high speeds and possibly flying off. The thought alone causes a smile to sneak across your face, but you quickly look away, blushing. <span style="Color: Yellow">What a stupid idea, someone like <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> would never be interested in something so childish!</span> <br>

