            {
                Name: "Xavier",
                State: {
                    Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Care for a spin?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> asks as if he read your mind. You quickly shake your head, saying you were just looking at it. Just admiring… the engineering, that’s it! You’re not really interested in stuff like that! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Really now? Because it looked like you wanted to go for a spin.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> chuckles, patting you on the shoulder, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t mind some childish fun every now and again. Come on.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> grabs you by the hand, taking away your choice, and walks over to the merry-go-round. <br>
<br>
You are still a little nervous as you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> both stand on either end. Then, together, you begin to kick off the ground the gain momentum. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">puts all his strength into it and soon you are spinning at high speeds! You try to contain your smile, but soon you can’t hold back as you chuckle, wind blowing through your hair as you get dizzier and dizzier! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>, meanwhile, just watches you and chuckles, seemingly not even affected by the spinning.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: Yellow">Then, for one reason or another, you lose your footing. Whether it is due to your trying to focus on keeping your cool, your general clumsiness, or even if you do it on purpose. You go flying off the piece of playground equipment and tumble into the sand.</span> While the sand breaks your fall, you do wonder how such a dangerous piece of playground equipment is even allowed. <br>

